Model "talker".

"chatter" is an object [role: topic, name: chatter].

"talker" is an object [role: system, name: talker].
"talker" consists of "chatter".
"talker" consists of "talker_ec".
"talker" exhibits "talker_talk0".

"talker_ec" is an object [role: ec, name: talker_ec, type: main_loop_ec, rate: 1].
"talker_ec" can be stopped or started.
"talker_ec" is initially started.

"talker_ec cycle" is a process [role: ec_cycle].
"talker_ec cycle" occurs if "talker_ec" is started, otherwise "talker_ec cycle" is skipped.
"talker_ec cycle" invokes "talker_talk0" [order: 0].
"talker_ec cycle" invokes itself.

"talker_talk0" is a process [role: process, name: talker_talk0, type: talker_talk].
"talker_talk0" yields "chatter".
"talker_talk0" yields "talker_talk0 out".

"talker_talk0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].
